    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0294" n="278" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg278"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.6363/3–1347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in Argentina
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-03-26T19:00:00-05:00">March 26, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>226. <hi rendition="#italic">La Prensa</hi> Mar 6 reports five bills introduced
                    Chamber Deputies recommending ban on mixed companies,<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d234-f1"/> expropriation private oil <pb facs="0295" n="279"
                        xml:id="pg279"/> companies, and other restrictive measures. What in opinion
                    Embassy are motives, likelihood action and possible result.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d234-f1" n="3" xml:id="d234-f1-content">
                <p>Companies jointly operated or regulated by private firms and by the state.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
